{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "management-toko-api-v1",
		"name": "Management Toko API",
		"description": "API Documentation untuk Aplikasi Management Toko (POS System)\n\n## Base URL\n- Development: `https://dev-api-toko.diprojectin.com`\n\n## Authentication\nSemua endpoint (kecuali login & register) memerlukan Bearer Token dari Laravel Sanctum.\n\n## Cara Penggunaan\n1. Register atau Login untuk mendapatkan `access_token`\n2. Set token di variable `{{token}}`\n3. Semua request yang memerlukan auth akan menggunakan header `Authorization: Bearer {{token}}`",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "base_url",
			"value": "https://dev-api-toko.diprojectin.com/api/v1",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "token",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Health Check",
			"description": "Endpoint untuk mengecek status API server",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Check Health",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "https://dev-api-toko.diprojectin.com/api/health",
							"protocol": "https",
							"host": ["dev-api-toko", "diprojectin", "com"],
							"path": ["api", "health"]
						},
						"description": "Mengecek apakah API server berjalan dengan baik. Endpoint ini tidak memerlukan autentikasi.\n\n**Response (200):**\n- `status`: Status server (ok)\n- `message`: Pesan status\n- `timestamp`: Waktu server saat ini (ISO 8601)\n- `app`: Nama aplikasi"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Auth",
			"description": "Endpoint untuk autentikasi user (Register, Login, Logout, Profile)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Register",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"name\": \"Budi Santoso\",\n    \"username\": \"budi123\",\n    \"email\": \"budi@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/register",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["auth", "register"]
						},
						"description": "Mendaftarkan user baru (Kasir)\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `name` (string, required): Nama lengkap\n- `username` (string, required): Username unik\n- `email` (string, required): Email unik\n- `password` (string, required): Password minimal 8 karakter\n\n**Response (201):**\n- `message`: Pesan sukses\n- `access_token`: Token untuk autentikasi\n- `token_type`: Bearer\n- `user`: Data user yang baru dibuat"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"if (jsonData.access_token) {",
									"    pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", jsonData.access_token);",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"budi@example.com\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["auth", "login"]
						},
						"description": "Login user dengan email/username dan password\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `email` (string, required): Email atau Username\n- `password` (string, required): Password\n\n**Response (200):**\n- `message`: Login successful\n- `access_token`: Token untuk autentikasi (otomatis tersimpan ke variable)\n- `token_type`: Bearer\n- `user`: Data user\n\n**Error (422):** Validation Error jika kredensial salah"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Forgot Password",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"budi@example.com\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/forgot-password",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["auth", "forgot-password"]
						},
						"description": "Step 1: Mengirim OTP ke email user\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `email` (string, required)\n\n**Response (200):**\n- `message`: OTP code has been sent to your email"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Reset Password",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"email\": \"budi@example.com\",\n    \"otp\": \"123456\",\n    \"password\": \"newpassword123\",\n    \"password_confirmation\": \"newpassword123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/reset-password",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["auth", "reset-password"]
						},
						"description": "Step 2: Reset password menggunakan OTP\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `email` (string, required)\n- `otp` (string, required): 6 digit dari email\n- `password` (string, required)\n- `password_confirmation` (string, required)\n\n**Response (200):**\n- `message`: Password has been reset successfully"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Change Password",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{token}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"current_password\": \"oldpassword123\",\n    \"new_password\": \"newpassword123\",\n    \"new_password_confirmation\": \"newpassword123\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/change-password",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["auth", "change-password"]
						},
						"description": "Mengganti password user yang sedang login\n\n**Headers:** Authorization: Bearer {token}\n\n**Request Body:**\n- `current_password` (string, required)\n- `new_password` (string, required, min 8 chars)\n- `new_password_confirmation` (string, required)\n\n**Response (200):**\n- `message`: Password changed successfully"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Logout",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{token}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["auth", "logout"]
						},
						"description": "Logout dan menghapus token yang sedang aktif\n\n**Headers:** Authorization: Bearer {token}\n\n**Response (200):**\n- `message`: Logged out successfully"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Current User",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [
								{
									"key": "token",
									"value": "{{token}}",
									"type": "string"
								}
							]
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/users/me",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["users", "me"]
						},
						"description": "Mendapatkan profil user yang sedang login\n\n**Headers:** Authorization: Bearer {token}\n\n**Response (200):**\n- `id`: ID user\n- `name`: Nama user\n- `email`: Email\n- `username`: Username\n- `role`: Role (kasir)\n- `is_active`: Status aktif"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Users",
